    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "team_0040_select_02",
      "hash64": "8DFCAA7950E4C1F1",
      "text": "聶凱？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_02",
      "hash64": "59AB8202A7EA8494",
      "text": "我再說一次，我現在是聶凱。\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳就配合一下吧。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_03",
      "hash64": "59AB8302A7EA8647",
      "text": "沒錯。我現在是聶凱。\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳很清楚狀況嘛。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_04",
      "hash64": "59AB8002A7EA812E",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n首先我要感謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_05",
      "hash64": "59AB8102A7EA82E1",
      "text": "託[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的福，\\n我才能加入星塵大作戰。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "team_0040_select_03",
      "hash64": "8DFCA97950E4C03E",
      "text": "你為了什麼？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "team_0040_select_04",
      "hash64": "8DFCAC7950E4C557",
      "text": "你的目的是？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_06",
      "hash64": "59AB7E02A7EA7DC8",
      "text": "我為了查明……\\n天星隊的問題以及謎團。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "team_0040_select_05",
      "hash64": "8DFCAB7950E4C3A4",
      "text": "問題？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "team_0040_select_06",
      "hash64": "8DFCAE7950E4C8BD",
      "text": "謎團？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_07",
      "hash64": "59AB7F02A7EA7F7B",
      "text": "因為他們的霸凌，\\n而迫使很多學生選擇了退學這條路……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "59AB7C02A7EA7A62",
      "text": "他們還窩在基地裡制定計畫，\\n準備襲擊學院……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_09",
      "hash64": "59AB7D02A7EA7C15",
      "text": "雖然有好幾個很糟糕的傳聞，\\n但傳聞畢竟是傳聞，\\r\\n現在面臨的最大問題是……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_10",
      "hash64": "59AEEA02A7ED6B23",
      "text": "那些隊員們實在\\n無故曠課太久了……\\r\\n根本完全不來上學。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_11",
      "hash64": "59AEE902A7ED6970",
      "text": "特別是有５名學生……\\n這５名在天星隊中被稱為老大的學生，\\r\\n已經１年以上沒有來學校了。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_12",
      "hash64": "59AEEC02A7ED6E89",
      "text": "加上最近天星隊的手下們\\n似乎開始在調皮搗蛋。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_13",
      "hash64": "59AEEB02A7ED6CD6",
      "text": "所以我向天星隊\\n提出了解散的請求。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_14",
      "hash64": "59AEEE02A7ED71EF",
      "text": "我還說如果他們無視我的請求，\\n那就只有讓他們退學了。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_15",
      "hash64": "59AEED02A7ED703C",
      "text": "但是，天星隊至今還沒有回覆我。\\n究竟是解散，還是退學，\\r\\n他們必須做出選擇的期限也迫在眉睫……[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_16",
      "hash64": "59AEF002A7ED7555",
      "text": "就在那時候，\\n我聽到了[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳和仙后在電話裡的對話。[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "team_0040_system_01",
      "hash64": "E9FA55E86C3AB05B",
      "text": "洛托洛托洛托……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "team_0040_cassiopeia_01",
      "hash64": "1B07436709C75031",
      "text": "……是我，仙后。\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳聽得到嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_17",
      "hash64": "59AEEF02A7ED73A2",
      "text": "！[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_18",
      "hash64": "59AEF202A7ED78BB",
      "text": "嘀嘀咕咕……（剩下的等有機會再說。）\\n嘀嘀咕咕……（那麼，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳小心點。）[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "team_0040_cassiopeia_02",
      "hash64": "1B07406709C74B18",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳似乎離基地很近了。\\n剛剛有誰……在那裡嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "team_0040_select_07",
      "hash64": "8DFCAD7950E4C70A",
      "text": "沒任何人",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "team_0040_select_08",
      "hash64": "8DFCA07950E4B0F3",
      "text": "只有我在",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "team_0040_cassiopeia_03",
      "hash64": "1B07416709C74CCB",
      "text": "……我們打倒了１個老大，\\n這讓天星隊更是嚴加戒備。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "team_0040_cassiopeia_04",
      "hash64": "1B07466709C7554A",
      "text": "進攻基地的難度\\n恐怕會比之前來得更高。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "team_0040_cassiopeia_05",
      "hash64": "1B07476709C756FD",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳隨時都要小心點。\\n我會再聯絡[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
